{"agent_id":"pp3g-GGEY-read-only-design-proposal-task-attempt-2-for-issue","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-10T02:35:23.251925580Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"8cda3348-0d9e-4809-b7da-afcddda27804","comment_uuid":"aa89058d-ceec-40b8-be8b-4bcd1d746683","author":"pp3g-GGEY-read-only-design-proposal-task-attempt-2-for-issue","content":"Plan: compose deny-by-default capability boundary proposal for read-only roles. Verification done: (1) --pure mechanism CONFIRMED at source — .opencode/opencode.json 'plugin' array (the 3 guards) resolves to plugin_origins; fork plugin/index.ts:179 'flags.pure ? [] : (cfg.plugin_origins ?? [])' empties them; internalPlugins() (line 66) contains only auth plugins (CodexAuthPlugin, CopilotAuthPlugin, ModalPlugin, GitlabAuthPlugin, PoeAuthPlugin, CloudflareWorkersAuthPlugin, CloudflareAIGatewayAuthPlugin, AzureAuthPlugin, DigitalOceanAuthPlugin, SnowflakeCortexAuthPlugin, XaiAuthPlugin) — NOT the guards. (2) Two-layer enforcement mapped: opencode permission block (agent .md) is the TRUE deny-by-default boundary; crosslink-guard plugin is a git-blocklist + active-issue gate, NOT a bash allowlist (relaxed mode section 7 + active-issue short-circuit section 9 allow non-list commands). (3) EXTENSION to auditor matrix: 'rtk *' is a broad proxy surface (rtk gh/glab/docker/kubectl/pnpm/dotnet/aws/psql/wget/git/test...), not just read-only file ops; hook-config allowed_bash_prefixes ALSO pass-throughs cargo/npm/npx/node/python/tsc/opencode for all agent types. Deliverable will cover: bypass matrix (verified+extended), exact per-grant keep/narrow/remove allowlists, --pure fix, tradeoffs, verification plan, what-not-tested.","created_at":"2026-08-10T02:35:23.244065619Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:3mlbg/Dgf8kfZ/IasWpZ2q0h/xqcztXi/OAgt6ZGqiA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgGDRmXVrleWlZftKV+IEkw3AylIa4j+6AY7GVERmtQM8AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAEvuXIJZadU